    <paragraph>
        See 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep8.html">
            PEP 8
        , 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep287.html">
            PEP
            287
        , 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep12.html">
            pep-0012
         and 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep12.html">
            pep-0012.txt
        , and 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep1.html">
            pep-12txt
        .
    <paragraph>
        Then 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc2822.html">
            RFC 2822
        , 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc822.html">
            RFC-822
        , 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc2616.html">
            RFC2616
         and 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc1.html">
            RFC  1
        .
    <paragraph>
        Not these: xPEP 8, PEP8, PEPs 8, pep-x, RFC-x, RFC 12a.
    <paragraph>
        Inside (
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep8.html">
            PEP 8
        ) and "
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc1.html">
            RFC 1
        ", and 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/PEP">
            https://example.org/PEP
         8 too.
    <paragraph>
        Roles: 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/peps/pep20.html">
            PEP 20
         and 
        <reference refuri="https://example.org/rfc/rfc2119.html#section-2">
            RFC 2119
        .
